      <h3 id="clusterqueue-share-value-zero_configuring-fairsharing" class="group scroll-mt-20">Zero weight<a href="#clusterqueue-share-value-zero_configuring-fairsharing" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
